<title>NETHERLANDS: Transavia 1996/97 net profit NLG 4.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Transavia 1996/97 net profit NLG 4.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996/97 to March 31.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     4.57  vs   17.65</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     4.53  vs    4.52</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues		 560.40  vs  552.33</p>
<p>    Net financial charges		     10.09  vs   10.66</p>
<p>    Extraordinary income			 0.05  vs   13.13</p>
<p>NOTE - Extraordinary items include a book profit of 3.8 million guilders on the sale of components and a provision of 3.8 million guilders for restructuring. Transavia is 80 percent owned by Dutch carrier KLM.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
